</ul><h1>Varied Varietals</h1><p>The cool thing about buying wine in bulk? The savings.</p>
<p>It’s just a fact: when you buy 6 or 12 wines, you can get a very reasonable price per bottle, even when the wine in question is unreasonably delicious.</p>
<p>The only problem with buying wine in bulk? The lack of variety.</p>
<p>While it can be rad to score something that’ll usually run you a pretty penny at a steep discount, it can start to feel like a slog when you’re drinking the same wine, bottle after bottle, for weeks or months on end.</p>
<p>Hence, we’re excited to offer this sale.</p>
